    "text": "<p>In the given reaction cycle</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/bfbbe798-4265-47d0-81b6-ad383eaa17e1.png\" style=\"width: 335px; height: 139px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math> respectively are</p>",
